warning at ./checker/add_new_media_type_params_modified.yaml, in API POST /api/v1.0/groups media type `application/json` was changed to `application/problem+json;q=1` for the response status `200` [response-media-type-name-changed]. This is a warning because oasdiff cannot tell what the changed media type parameter constrains. Adding one narrows what the server may return, removing one widens it, and changing its value may leave a client unable to read the response.


